      "id": 11028,
      "name": "tzgardner",
      "username": "tzgardner",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/b77776/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-18T22:27:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was looking for some ideas for helping to speed up the game.&nbsp; (Please don't say to play faster.)&nbsp; Some Villains seem to take longer than others to play.&nbsp; Some games I've played took 2+ hours to get through.&nbsp; Sometimes I'll be playing for over an hour and the Villain hasn't even taken a hit.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For me, the most fun games are the ones I can get though in an hour or less (Baron Blade, Ambuscade, etc)&nbsp; The least fun for me are the ones that take over 2 hours (akash'bhuta is the one I particularly notice).&nbsp; Please list any other Villains that seems to drag games out and give ideas how to speed it up but still be challenging.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I haven't tried it yet but reducing HP of the Villains comes to mind but not sure if it'll make the Villains too easy.&nbsp;</p>",
