      "created_at": "2014-08-18T23:26:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm not entirely sure what you're asking for.&nbsp; If you just want the games to take less time, then a simple change like giving the heroes +1 to all damage would help move things along.&nbsp; But maybe you want the games to go more quickly without also being easier?&nbsp; I guess you're just looking for a list of the quickest villains in the game?&nbsp; Iron Legacy tends to be the quickest game as near as I can tell - you either get stomped immediately or you get lucky and stomp him immediately.&nbsp; But somehow I don't think this is useful info to you.</p>",
