      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-19T20:11:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My game group plays Sentinels at our&nbsp;lunch hour every Friday. We have specified&nbsp;which villains are lunch villains and which are not. Here is our list of&nbsp;\"lunch villains.\" They consistently play in an hour or less.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Baron Blade</p><p>Bomber Blade</p><p>Omnitron</p><p>Cosmic Omnitron</p><p>Plague Rat</p><p>Normal mode Ennead</p><p>Skinwalker Gloomweaver</p><p>Ambuscade</p><p>Dreamer</p><p>Iron Legacy</p><p>Kismet</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You are certainly welcome to argue one way or another on the remaining villains. I agree that some games against Chairman are very quick. Some are extremely long. This list is just the ones that consistently finish in an hour.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
