      "created_at": "2014-08-23T16:33:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I played a game vs. Iron Legacy (IL) this last weekend that took an hour and a half.&nbsp; Team was:</p><p>Sentinels, DW Setback, Scholar, Naturalist.</p><p>If Setback hadn't died early on, the Sentinals would have been toast.&nbsp; As it is, he gave them an extra power each turn, and Naturalist removed Iron Legacy's Ongoings.&nbsp; But yeah, usually IL games are 2 or 3 rounds. :D</p>",
